        "release_date": "1980-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
        "description": "\"Odd Room Escape\" transforms your room into the stage for a peculiar Mixed Reality escape game. The rules are simple: \n- **If you spot an anomaly, drink the \"Red Pill.\"**\n- **If everything seems normal, drink the \"Blue Pill.\"**\n\n# Spot the Differences\n**Your mission is to find the changes** in a room where the real and virtual worlds merge. Don't miss the shifts in object states or placements—use your full observational skills to discover the anomalies.\n{990514239497906}\n\n# Enjoy the Surprises\nExperience the thrill and excitement of strange phenomena suddenly appearing in your room, and familiar scenes transforming before your eyes. The sensation of reality shifting through the use of MR technology **offers an unprecedented sense of wonder.**\n{528546996462557}\n\n# Character Import\n**You can bring your favorite characters into the game.** These characters will create unique and adorable anomalies in your room. Interacting with them will create a new gaming experience.\n{515660261314253}",
